      "source": "Schema support can assist you throughout the application development lifecycle.\nIn differential mode, you provide an existing Liquibase <code>Database</code> to the schema writer instance and the schema writer compares existing tables to mapped entities and derives from the difference which tables and columns to create/to drop.\nBy default, no tables and no columns are dropped unless you configure <code>dropTableFilter</code> and <code>dropColumnFilter</code>.\nBoth filter predicates provide the table name respective column name so your code can compute which tables and columns can be dropped.",
      "translation": "架构支持可协助您完成整个应用程序开发生命周期。  \n在差异模式下，您需要向架构生成器实例提供一个现有的 Liquibase <code>Database</code>，架构生成器将比较现有表与映射实体，并根据差异确定需要创建或删除哪些表和列。  \n默认情况下，除非配置了 <code>dropTableFilter</code> 和 <code>dropColumnFilter</code>，否则不会删除任何表或列。  \n这两个过滤谓词会提供相应的表名和列名，以便您的代码计算可以删除哪些表和列。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Column types are computed from an object implementing the <code>SqlTypeMapping</code> strategy interface.\nNullability is inferred from the type and set to <code>false</code> if a property type uses primitive Java types.",
      "translation": "列类型是根据实现<code>SqlTypeMapping</code>策略接口的对象计算得出的。空值性根据类型推断，如果属性类型使用原始 Java 类型，则设置为<code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "When working with SQL databases, the schema is an essential part.\nSpring Data JDBC supports a wide range of schema options yet when starting with a domain model it can be challenging to come up with an initial domain model.\nTo assist you with a code-first approach, Spring Data JDBC ships with an integration to create database change sets using <a href=\"https://www.liquibase.org/\">Liquibase</a>.",
      "translation": "在使用 SQL 数据库时，模式（schema）是至关重要的一部分。Spring Data JDBC 支持多种模式选项，但在从领域模型开始时，构建初始的领域模型可能会具有挑战性。为了协助您采用代码优先的方法，Spring Data JDBC 集成了使用 <a href=\"https://www.liquibase.org/\">Liquibase</a> 创建数据库变更集的功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
