      "source": "<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nSchema support can only identify additions and removals in the sense of removing tables/columns that are not mapped or adding columns that do not exist in the database.\nColumns cannot be renamed nor data cannot be migrated because entity mapping does not provide details of how the schema has evolved.\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>",
      "translation": "<td class=\"icon\">\n<i class=\"fa icon-note\" title=\"Note\"></i>\n</td>\n<td class=\"content\">\nSchema 支持仅能识别增删操作，具体而言是移除未映射的表/列，或添加数据库中不存在的列。\n由于实体映射未提供模式演变的详细信息，因此无法重命名列，也无法迁移数据。\n</td>\n</tr>",
      "count": 1
    },
